# 100005 (DOM Temperature). entPhySensorTable: power in watts, scale
# milli(8), precision 4; temperature celsius, units(9), precision 1.
# Rx 0.5012 mW = -3.00 dBm, Tx 0.6310 mW = -2.00 dBm, 40.5 C.
